    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Game is Now Available for Early Access!</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 chapters of linear main storyline, with 30 main levels<br></li><li>10 different playable characters<br></li><li>A talent tree system with 26 unique large talent points<br></li><li>A chip system with over 100 attribute-enhancing entries<br></li><li>30 additional challenging free-play levels</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Introduction</h2></strong><br>Mystery of Dust is an <strong>RPG game</strong> with <strong>tower defense strategy elements</strong>. Players take on the role of &quot;Lisha Komo,&quot; a girl caught in an &quot;intelligent machine rebellion&quot; sweeping the city. Granted the powerful &quot;Memory Core,&quot; she uses &quot;Heroic Memories&quot; from past wars to fight. Due to her unique abilities, she forms a team to resolve the rebellion and uncover its source.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2D Tower Defense Battles</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/5e5b389deb5b611b26bb274eef6d4de9.poster.avif?t=1720778411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/5e5b389deb5b611b26bb274eef6d4de9.webm?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/5e5b389deb5b611b26bb274eef6d4de9.mp4?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Deserts, factories, nights, days... Use your Memory Core to strategize and defeat various enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Memory Cores</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/dce386286674a1d0945307532e51217a.poster.avif?t=1720778411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/dce386286674a1d0945307532e51217a.webm?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/dce386286674a1d0945307532e51217a.mp4?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>10 playable Memory Cores, each with a unique skill. Understand their uses and form a cohesive team!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chip Equipment</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/fd137cc46dc59b42bd2c41a447f3d104.poster.avif?t=1720778411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/fd137cc46dc59b42bd2c41a447f3d104.webm?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/fd137cc46dc59b42bd2c41a447f3d104.mp4?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A chip system with over 100 attribute-enhancing entries. Unique set chip effects can drastically change combat styles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Talent System</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/7adb1b7ed1a5914b65be226e13efd072.poster.avif?t=1720778411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/7adb1b7ed1a5914b65be226e13efd072.webm?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/7adb1b7ed1a5914b65be226e13efd072.mp4?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A large talent tree to customize your team's strengths and weaknesses, supporting your strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Levels</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/32dfdc57111906cbe2d0cb9c195cfe5b.poster.avif?t=1720778411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/32dfdc57111906cbe2d0cb9c195cfe5b.webm?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/32dfdc57111906cbe2d0cb9c195cfe5b.mp4?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Free-play levels graded by difficulty, offering additional rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Linear Storyline</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/3052d4e01e43886aaab9bbb741149d68.poster.avif?t=1720778411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/3052d4e01e43886aaab9bbb741149d68.webm?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656840/extras/3052d4e01e43886aaab9bbb741149d68.mp4?t=1720778411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Follow Lisha's journey through a captivating storyline.",
